  <p style="margin-top:12px;">The category has undergone several structural changes — at various points splitting into separate awards for dramatic and comedy/musical scores — but this analysis follows the consolidated one-winner-per-year convention. Composer names have been standardized; where multiple composers shared an award, each is counted individually.</p>
