            "heralded the rise of the media-mogul composer-producer. "
            f"{stats['unique_composers']} unique composers won across {stats['ceremonies']} ceremonies."
        )
    else:
        return (
            "The Contemporary era is defined by unprecedented global diversity. Winners hail from Italy, "
            "Argentina, India, Iceland, Germany, and beyond. Alexandre Desplat and Ludwig Goransson "
